            <a class="oyh-blocker oyh-blocker--link" href="/move-up-sellers"><p class="oyh-blocker__quote">The full plan</p><p>Prepare, Buy &amp; Sell, Move Once: the whole move on one page.</p></a>
            <a class="oyh-blocker oyh-blocker--link" href="/buy-before-you-sell"><p class="oyh-blocker__quote">Buy before you sell</p><p>Move once, then get the old home ready without living through it.</p></a>
