            <li><a href="https://homelightblog.wpengine.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/HomeLight-Top-Agents-Insights-Report-Q3-2025.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">HomeLight, Top Agent Insights, Q3 2025</a></li>
            <li><a href="https://www.jlconline.com/cost-vs-value/2025/mountain/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Zonda/JLC, 2025 Cost vs. Value Report, Mountain Region</a></li>
