            <li><a href="https://www.businesswire.com/news/home/20251007973292/en/Redfin-Reports-Nearly-60000-Home-Purchases-Were-Called-Off-in-August" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Redfin, Home-Purchase Cancellations, October 2025</a></li>
